<h1>Semantic diffs for UnityYAML assets</h1>
<p>
  PrefabLens shows semantic diffs in views like Unity's Hierarchy and Inspector.
  You can use PrefabLens on GitHub pull requests, in the terminal, and in the Unity Editor.
</p>

<!--
  The same Robot.prefab change appears in both views. The build generates the raw diff with Git
  and the semantic diff report with the prefablens binary.
-->
